{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约伯记","commonName":"约伯记","title":"约伯记","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"1a81bb70cf0a6a7c1a1cb5467ce5d2ed020992a97cf8ea0fae07c18b9e6c434a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1068},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["约伯回答耶和华说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“我知道你无所不能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的旨意无不成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你问，‘是谁用无知蒙蔽我的旨意？’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诚然，我对所谈的事一无所知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些事太奇妙，我无法明白。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你说，‘你且听着，我要发言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我来提问，你来回答。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从前风闻有你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在亲眼看见你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我厌恶自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在尘土和炉灰中忏悔。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["结语"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和华对约伯说完这些话后，就对提幔人以利法说：“你和你的两个朋友让我愤怒，因为你们对我的议论不如我仆人约伯说的有理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["现在你们要取七头公牛和七只公羊，到我仆人约伯那里，为自己献上燔祭，因为你们对我的议论不如我仆人约伯说的有理。我仆人约伯会为你们祷告，我会悦纳他的祷告，不按你们的愚妄惩罚你们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["于是，提幔人以利法、书亚人比勒达和拿玛人琐法遵命而行，耶和华悦纳了约伯的祷告。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["约伯为朋友们祷告后，耶和华恢复了他以前的昌盛，并且耶和华赐给他的比以前多一倍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["约伯的兄弟姊妹和从前的朋友都来探望他，在他家里一同吃饭，为他遭受耶和华所降的种种灾难而安抚、慰问他。他们每人送他一块银子和一个金环。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和华赐给约伯晚年的福分比起初更多：他有一万四千只羊、六千只骆驼、一千对牛和一千头母驴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他还有七个儿子和三个女儿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他给长女取名叫耶米玛、次女叫基洗亚、三女叫基连·哈朴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["地上找不到像约伯三个女儿那样美丽的女子。约伯让她们与弟兄一同承受产业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["此后，约伯又活了一百四十年，得见四代子孙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["约伯年纪老迈，寿终正寝。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}